  "notes": [
    "A2 and A3 row coverage follows client-source constructions and historical bounded operator reports; not a live vendor schema.",
    "HTTP entries expand A2-E01..E18 into separate method and path combinations. WebSocket entries preserve all A3-E01..E25 including grouped A3-E14.",
    "B3 first-party Location observed once; no S3 object GET performed. No target fetch, control frames, POST graph2 or controller mutation is authorized by this map.",
    "A legal/technical request may involve variants not represented in the reviewed sources; this map is not an exhaustive enumeration of all Orbit endpoints.",
    "Supplemental A4/earlier evidence beyond A2/A3 core adds REST landscape-description PUT (API-EV-017) and three named WS handled events (API-EV-058/024); these are source-only.",
    "Operator-reported C1 API-EV-061: 7 first-party requests including login, all six GETs HTTP 200; event-log page-size variations did not alter per-page result arrays (100 on page 1; 0 on page 2), program unfiltered/filtered full JSON equal (5). C1 once-only consent consumed. Does not establish general paging, cap, filter semantics or archive completeness.",
    "C2 API-EV-062: one owner-authorized login POST and five first-party account-scoped devices GETs (6 physical requests; 0 target requests). Login API key present, session token absent, token-only request skipped. Origin/Referer/configured-User-Agent single omissions had HTTP 200 and baseline-identical arrays; App-ID omission HTTP 401. C2 one-run authorization consumed; no universal header/token conclusions.",
    "API-EV-063 (C3 one authorized run, operator reported): 16 physical requests, 6 REST pages to empty, 68 containers, first-page recheck unchanged; selected Aug 6-8 had 21 REST irrigation events. Aug 7 REST/asset 21/21 agreement with 0 recognized conflicts; Aug 6/8 acquired assets contained explicit watering_events null and are inconclusive (not zero). One-run C3 authorization consumed. Retention/versioning and prior Aug 7 null discrepancy still unresolved; zone-report S3 access remains forbidden.",
    "API-EV-065 (C3G operator-reported live and offline outcomes): one authorized 8-day private decoded daily-asset capture used 19/19 allowed physical requests and saved 8 JSON + 8 SHA-256 sidecars; C3F no-network offline audit reported all 8 local pairs VERIFIED, 6 populated irrigation arrays (72 entries total) and 2 EXPLICIT_NULL assets on the operator's Aug 6/8 no-watering controls. This is day-level consistency, not independent event-count or historical object-version proof; null is still structurally unknown, not zero. C3G one-run live permission consumed; no new zone S3 allowlist. The REST-17/18 row evidence_addendum remains API-EV-063 to preserve earlier source-traceability regression expectations; API-EV-065 is this additional sample.",
    "API-EV-070 (C4-E operator-reported bounded first-party REST): the previously inventoried but NOT_TESTED_ID_MISSING REST-09 GET /v1/meshes/{mesh_id} returned HTTP 200 JSON object after one authorized login and eight-local-archive selector preflight. Only id, devices and created_at top-level keys present among seven fixed keys; devices is an array, content and length not assessed. Top-level mesh_id, name, network_topology_id, updated_at absent. Returned id equality to requested mesh and selected device membership not checked. 2/2 physical HTTP requests used; no retries, redirects, raw persistence or further live consent. Historical observation preserved; census unchanged."
  ],
